    "quote_count": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "4004",
    "author_id": "3004",
    "text": "Frank DeLuca used to tell me: time isn't about counting \u2014 it's about breathing. Twenty years later, it still lands different every time.",
    "created_at": "2026-02-22T09:12:00.000Z",
    "lang": "en",
    "reply_to_tweet_id": "100000",
    "like_count": 540,
    "retweet_count": 210,
    "reply_count": 44,
    "quote_count": 12
  },
  {
    "id": "4005",
    "author_id": "3001",
    "text": "Hot take: the best thing about jazz is that you can never truly 'finish' learning it. Every master is still a student.",
